{"title": "Shocking Sting", "pageid": 27958, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shocking_Sting", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shocking Sting</b> is a passive feature that lets the weapon shock your target.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>On a hit, possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shock\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shock</a><sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> your target. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Shocking_Grasp\"> Condition: Shocking Grasp </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shocking Grasp</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;13)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;13)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Cannot take <a href=\"/wiki/Reactions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reactions\">Reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Jabber\" title=\"Lightning Jabber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Kuotoa_Javelin_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Jabber\" title=\"Lightning Jabber\">Lightning Jabber</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Kuo-Toa_Chief\" title=\"Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief\">Cursed Kuo-Toa Chief</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip for Shocking Sting says it has chance to apply <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocked\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f3/Shocked_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocked_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocked (Condition)\">Shocked</a>, but the condition actually applied is the similar but less potent <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shocking Grasp</a>.</li>\n<li>There is a saving throw for the Shocking Grasp condition, but the combat log does not show it.</li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Applies <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shocking Grasp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Shocking_Grasp_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shocking_Grasp_(Condition)\" title=\"Shocking Grasp (Condition)\">Shocking Grasp</a> on a hit.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201544\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2464/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24183/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7195/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 163/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLu